ading/?debate=kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023#occurrence-fallacy-special-pleading-kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023-bernardo-kastrup-revisability-telepathy-and-materialism-1-19-40-supporting-reply","context":"Kastrup says telepathic leakage occurs in emotional life but disappears under controlled laboratory conditions."},{"label":"Base-rate neglect","href":"/reference/bias/base-rate-neglect/?debate=kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023#occurrence-bias-base-rate-neglect-kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023-bernardo-kastrup-revisability-telepathy-and-materialism-1-21-46-supporting-reply","context":"Kastrup treats one vivid dream match as compelling without comparing ordinary dream and coincidence frequencies."},{"label":"Subjective validation","href":"/reference/bias/subjective-validation/?debate=kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023#occurrence-bias-subjective-validation-kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023-bernardo-kastrup-revisability-telepathy-and-materialism-1-21-46-supporting-reply","context":"Kastrup says a personally witnessed dream coincidence was so specific he could not dismiss it."},{"label":"Confirmation bias","href":"/reference/bias/confirmation-bias/?debate=kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023#occurrence-bias-confirmation-bias-kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023-bernardo-kastrup-revisability-telepathy-and-materialism-1-25-09-load-bearing-constructive","context":"Kastrup says changing his view would require becoming a child and unlearning forty-eight years."},{"label":"Red herring","href":"/reference/fallacy/red-herring/?debate=kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023#occurrence-fallacy-red-herring-kastrup-blackmore-conscious-illusion-2023-bernardo-kastrup-revisability-telepathy-and-materialism-1-25-09-load-bearing-constructive","context":"Asked for a revision condition, Kastrup shifts to the Flying Spaghetti Monster, church politics, and Enlightenment history."}],"overallLinks":[{"label":"Confirmation bias"